{"speciesId":633,"names":{"fr":"Solochi","es":"Deino","en":"Deino","ja":"モノズ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il mord tout ce qui bouge, et mange tout ce qu’il trouve. Il vaut mieux éviter de s’en approcher."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It tends to bite everything, and it is not a picky eater. Approaching it carelessly is dangerous."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Comme il ne voit rien, il perçoit son environnement en mordant et en fonçant à tout va. Il est couvert de plaies."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"They cannot see, so they tackle and bite to learn about their surroundings. Their bodies are covered in wounds."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Lacking sight, it’s unaware of its surroundings, so it bumps into things and eats anything that moves."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Lacking sight, it’s unaware of its surroundings, so it bumps into things and eats anything that moves."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Comme il ne voit rien, il perçoit son environnement en mordant et en fonçant à tout va. Il est couvert de plaies."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"No ve, por eso va haciendo placajes y dando mordiscos a diestro y siniestro. Su cuerpo está plagado de heridas."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"They cannot see, so they tackle and bite to learn about their surroundings. Their bodies are covered in wounds."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"目が 見えないため 体当たりしたり かみついて まわりを 探る。 体中 生傷が 絶えない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Comme il ne voit rien, il perçoit son environnement en mordant et en fonçant à tout va."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"No ve bien a su alrededor, por eso va chocándose a diestro y siniestro, y mordiendo todo lo que se mueve."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Lacking sight, it’s unaware of its surroundings, so it bumps into things and eats anything that moves."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","tex